<metadata preset-name="Bakersfield Twang" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="Hard, bright West Coast country twang: a loud high-powered blackface twin with the bright switch on and treble and mids up, no compressor, a short slap and a little of the amp's own spring. Bridge pickup, played near the bridge with a thin pick; turn the guitar down to tame it rather than the amp." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
